    {
      "name": "lever_invisible_hcaptcha",
      "source": "jobs.lever.co/palantir/* (3 postings), read 2026-08-12",
      "note": "Lever renders hCaptcha programmatically in invisible mode and never writes data-size, so the attribute-only reading saw a bare [data-sitekey] and called it rendered. Measured on the live page: container 1380x0, clientHeight 0, two visibility:hidden iframes, h-captcha-response empty and display:none. Nothing is shown to anyone. The runner predicate and the direct Playwright predicate both said false; the managed predicate said true and blocked all three.",
